  "term": "narcissism",
  "definition": "Narcissism is a personality trait within the Dark Triad, alongside Machiavellianism and psychopathy. The packet describes two main forms, grandiose and vulnerable narcissism, and notes that although narcissism is often linked with negative outcomes, grandiose narcissism may in some settings be associated with stronger learning-related and cognitive performance.",
